        "TileImage": "$($repository b549bc14-ce14-445d-9278-ec27f19ff342).Image",
        "Description": "Good evening, 47. Your target is the Ark Society&apos;s mortician, Muriel Mortsen. She&apos;s been tasked to prepare Janus for burial but seems to be at a halt. She&apos;s a smart and cunning member, and while not as wicked as Janus she has her fair share of past crimes. Remember to beware of the guards surrounding her and keeping watch over Janus&apos; body, they cannot be allowed to report about your presence or Mortensen&apos;s passing.",
